OL,3,GNEWSAGirl died after speeding car hit
OL,4,Apothole, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl died after the speeding
OL,7,Fcar she was in struck a pothole and
OL,8,Fplunged into a river, an inquest into
OL,9,Fher death has heard.
OL,11,FEden Bunn, 16, was a rear seat
OL,12,Fpassenger in a VW Polo driven by Declan
OL,13,FBerry, 18, which had been travelling at
OL,14,Fabout 90mph moments before entering the
OL,15,FRiver Nene, near Wisbech, in
OL,16,FCambridgeshire on 17 March.
OL,18,FWhile three other occupants escaped,
OL,19,FEden died from a head injury. Declan's
OL,20,Fbody was recovered two weeks later.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
