OL,3,GNEWSAGirl died after speeding car hit
OL,4,Apothole, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquest in Huntingdon heard a
OL,7,Fpolice report had found the driver's
OL,8,Fspeed was "the most significant
OL,9,Fcontributory factor" to the crash, but
OL,10,Fthe condition of the road and presence
OL,11,Fof potholes also contributed.
